        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A relation between two distinct material entities, the new entity and the old entity, in which the new entity begins to exist through the separation or transformation of a part of the old entity, and the new entity inherits a significant portion of the matter belonging to that part of the old entity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
