        <obo:IAO_0000115>A has part relationship between a whole and a part, where the number of parts present in the whole is higher than in comparable entities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment>This relation is present in ENVO to support compositional classes such as &quot;X-enriched soil&quot;. These will later be formalized, and a different relation from RO may be chosen.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>has increased levels of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://github.com/EnvironmentOntology/envo/issues/1380"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


