        <obo:IAO_0000115>This property only applies to anatomical entities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dcterms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6677-8489"/>
        <dcterms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2024-10-29T09:55:07Z</dcterms:date>
        <rdfs:label>is anatomical entity</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0020337 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0020337">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002180"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A relation that holds between a polymer and its constituent monomers. P has_constituent_monomer c if and only if P has_component multiple instances of c and each instance of c is covalently attached to another instance of c.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>RO:0020337</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>protein</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>has_constituent_monomer</oboInOwl:id>
        <oboInOwl:is_transitive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</oboInOwl:is_transitive>
        <oboInOwl:shorthand>has_constituent_monomer</oboInOwl:shorthand>
        <rdfs:comment>The constituent monomers need not be covalently attached in an end-to-end manner; that is, polymers with internal connections (e.g., polyubiquitin) can use this relation, as can circular polymers (e.g., plasmids) and multi-branched polymers (e.g., glycans). This relation, as non-transitive, allows one to indicate the number of instances of c.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>has_constituent_monomer</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0020337"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A relation that holds between a polymer and its constituent monomers. P has_constituent_monomer c if and only if P has_component multiple instances of c and each instance of c is covalently attached to another instance of c.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PRO:DAN</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


