            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A biological macromolecule minimally consisting of one polypeptide chain synthesized at the ribosome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An amino acid chain that is canonically produced de novo by ribosome-mediated translation of a genetically-encoded mRNA, and any derivatives thereof.</obo:IAO_0000115>
