        <obo:IAO_0000115>A specialized epithelial cell involved in sensory perception. Restricted to special sense organs of the olfactory, gustatory, and vestibulocochlear receptor systems; contain sensory cells surrounded by supportive, non-receptive cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>neuroepithelial cell</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0004301</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The term &quot;neuroepithelial cell&quot; is used to describe both this cell type and neurecto-epithelial cell (CL:0000710).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>sensory epithelial cell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
