            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A process in which force is generated within muscle tissue, resulting in a change in muscle geometry. Force generation involves a chemo-mechanical energy conversion step that is carried out by the actin/myosin complex activity, which generates force through ATP hydrolysis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Muscle_contraction</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
