        <owl:annotatedTarget>The regulated release of proinsulin from secretory granules accompanied by cleavage of proinsulin to form mature insulin. In vertebrates, insulin is secreted from B granules in the B cells of the vertebrate pancreas and from insulin-producing cells in insects.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GOC:mah</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:0198506732</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


