        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>Golgi-vacuole transport vesicle</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>cellular_component</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>secretory vesicle</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>GO:0030133</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Note that the term &apos;secretory vesicle&apos; is sometimes used in this sense, but can also mean &apos;secretory granule ; GO:0030141&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
