        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The biological process whose specific outcome is the progression of a neural nucleus from its initial condition to its mature state. A neural nucleus is an anatomical structure consisting of a discrete aggregate of neuronal soma.</obo:IAO_0000115>
