        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process of creating a trabecula in an organ. A trabecula is a small, often microscopic, tissue element in the form of a small beam, strut or rod, which generally has a mechanical function. Trabecula are usually but not necessarily, composed of dense collagenous tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>trabeculation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
