        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process whose specific outcome is the progression of a trachea over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The trachea is the portion of the airway that attaches to the bronchi as it branches.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
