        <owl:annotatedTarget>A part of a cellular organism consisting of a material entity with granularity above the level of a protein complex but below that of an anatomical system. Note that cellular organisms exclude viruses.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GOC:kmv</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
