        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>protein transport chaperone</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>GO:0140318</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Examples of protein carriers include the soluble TIM chaperone complexes of S. cerevisiae Tim9-Tim10 and Tim8-Tim13, that provide a shuttle system between TOM and the membrane insertases TIM22 and SAM and, thus, ensure that precursors are kept in a translocation-competent conformation.</rdfs:comment>
