        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A physical quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s exhibiting the physical characteristics of an entity consisting of particles that have neither a defined volume nor defined shape.</owl:annotatedTarget>
