        <obo:IAO_0000115>A primordium (PO:0025127) that develops from a phyllome anlagen (PO:0025430) and is part of a shoot apex (PO:0000037) and is committed to the development of a phyllome (PO:0006001).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>rwalls</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2010-11-15T09:27:11Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
