        <obo:IAO_0000115>Study of the measurement, effects and regulation of wireless communication signals, for example mobile phone radiation and microwave communication.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>0000-0002-5111-7263</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>wireless communication radiation study</rdfs:label>
