        <owl:annotatedTarget>Common chamber into which the intestines and excretory system opens. Arises during development in all vertebrates, but in many it becomes subdivided, lost or incorporated into other structures.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:resource="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cloaca"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:0073040584</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
