        <obo:IAO_0000115>Primary germ layer that is the outer of the embryo&apos;s three germ layers and gives rise to epidermis and neural tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Primary germ layer that is the outer of the embryonic germ layers and gives rise to epidermis and neural tissue.[AAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
