        <obo:UBPROP_0000010>lacks submucosa and cartilage plates; they have 3 layers: mucosa, muscular layer and outer layer</obo:UBPROP_0000010>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>In FMA2 and FMA3, lobular bronchiole is an exact synonym of bronchiole; however, there are two distinct terms for the corresponding epithelium.</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
