        <owl:annotatedTarget>Arteries that connect the dorsal aorta and the dorsal longitudinal anastomotic vessel. They run along the vertical myotomal boundaries. At early stages these vessels don&apos;t have venous or arteriproperty_value external_definitionmarkers. They form from the primary sprouts from the dorsal aorta[ZFA:0001061].</owl:annotatedTarget>
