        <oboInOwl:source>DOI:10.1002/dvdy.21177 Kusakabe R and Kuratani S. Evolutionary perspectives from development of mesodermal components in the lamprey. Developmental dynamics (2007)</oboInOwl:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
