        <owl:annotatedTarget>A subdivision of the skeleton that corresponds to the upper part of the mouth. The lower jaw skeleton includes the following elements, when present: upper jaw teeth, the maxilla and other lower jaw bones.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:resource="http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165"/>
