        <obo:IAO_0000115>Collections of neurons in the central nervous system that have been demonstrated by histochemical fluorescence to contain the neurotransmitter norepinephrine (noradrenalin).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>uberon</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
