        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000000"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A unit which is a standard measure of the rate of angular movement about an axis; the angle rotated in a given time.</obo:IAO_0000115>
