        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000095"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A unit which is a standard measure of the volume of a homogeneous substance containing 6.02 x 1023 atoms or molecules.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment>&quot;A unit which is a standard measure of the volume of a homogeneous substance containing 6.02 x 1023 atoms or molecules.&quot; [Wikipedia:Wikipedia]</rdfs:comment>
