        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000095"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A unit which is a standard measure of the volume of a given mass of substance (the reciprocal of density).</obo:IAO_0000115>
