        <obo:IAO_0000115>A unit which is a standard measure of the amount of radiation emitted by a given radiation source as well as the amount of radiation absorbed or deposited in a specific material by a radiation source.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment>&quot;A unit which is a standard measure of the amount of radiation emitted by a given radiation source as well as the amount of radiation absorbed or deposited in a specific material by a radiation source.&quot; [OCRBS:OCRBS]</rdfs:comment>
