        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000261"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A unit which represents a standard measurement of the spontaneous transfer of thermal energy through matter, from a region of higher temperature to a region of lower temperature.</obo:IAO_0000115>
