        <obo:IAO_0000111>volumetric flow rate unit</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A unit which is a standard measure of the volume of fluid which passes through a given surface per unit time .</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000412 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uo.owl"/>
        <rdfs:comment>&quot;A unit which is a standard measure of the volume of fluid which passes through a given surface per unit time .&quot; [Wikipedia:Wikipedia]</rdfs:comment>
