    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000013">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A substance unit which is equal to the amount of substance of a molecular system which contains as many elementary entities as there are atoms in 0.012 kilogram of carbon 12.</obo:IAO_0000115>
