    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000014">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A luminous intensity unit which equal to the luminous intensity, in a given direction, of a source that emits monochromatic radiation of frequency 540 x 1012 hertz and that has a radiant intensity in that direction of 1/683 watt per steradian.</obo:IAO_0000115>
