        <obo:IAO_0000115>A unit per milliliter unit which is equal to one unit of an agreed arbitrary amount per one liter.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>U/l</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
