    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000181">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A catalytic unit activity which is equal to the amount of the enzyme that catalyzes the conversion of 1 micro mole of substrate per minute.</obo:IAO_0000115>
