    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000216">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An activity (of a radionuclide) unit which is equal to the activity of a quantity of radioactive material in which one nucleus decays per second or there is one atom disintegration per second.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>dps</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
