    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000221">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An independently to the base SI units defined mass unit which is equal to one twelfth of the mass of an unbound atom of the carbon-12 nuclide, at rest and in its ground state.</obo:IAO_0000115>
