    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000226">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A magnetic flux unit which is equal to the amount of flux that when linked with a single turn of wire for an interval of one second will induce an electromotive force of one volt.</obo:IAO_0000115>
