    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000237">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An image resolution unit which is a standard measure of the amount of spatial detail in an image.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment>&quot;An image resolution unit which is a standard measure of the amount of spatial detail in an image.&quot; [Wikipedia:Wikipedia]</rdfs:comment>
