    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000240">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A spatial resolution unit which is a standard measure of the printing resolution, in particular the number of individual dots of ink a printer or toner can produce within a linear one-inch space.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>dpi</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
