    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000310">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A concentration unit which is a standard measure of the amount of a toxic or pharmaceutical substance administered over time to a recipient subject, expressed in terms of the size of the subject.</obo:IAO_0000115>
